- Citing soft-deleted / archived Deals or Opportunities as active
- Serving `MOCK_*` / dashboard demo KPIs when demo seeds are disabled
- Using `local_fallback` LoanFile books for advice while Deal Registry is operational
- Parallel metric formulas for ticker / briefing / Mission Control counters

